                     |GKBQUIVERING PALM
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'Chi is a flowing force; thus it may be disrupted like any
stream.'|WKO - |RKBMaster Hu Fong|WKO

|YKOA Monk is able to channel their Ancient Energy into a 
chi-disrupting wave emanating from the Palm.  When a foe
is struck with this wave, their whole chi balance is thrown
off for a time.

|BK0This is a Master of the West Wind power.

|YKO================================================================

In addition, Palm is a skill that relates directly to this
power.

|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++|GKB
                        |GKBSKILL OF PALM
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++|GKB

|YKB'Disrupt the soul and you own the body.'|WK0 - |RKBLord Sal Matis
|YK0
Palm is a Monk specific stat. It relates primarily to a Monks
ability to reach a harmonic balance with the universe and to
translate that balance into a destructive force. The greater
the Palm ability of a Monk, the more dangerous the results
of this skill will be. All Monks gain a rudimentary knowlege
of this skill, but it requires study to take full advantage
of it.
